# TIN TROOP 2-C, start to finish with plain button presses (recorded once
# from a route plan). A stone dropped down the hole puts out the candles
# at its foot and makes a step; the pill bug rolling in the soap dish goes
# off and breaks through the tin soap box, which a Pop would only crack;
# two stones, each half off the edge of the one below, make a stair up to
# the high ledge.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 5
wait 66
hold RIGHT 169
hold RIGHT+A 18
hold DOWN+B 2
wait 58
hold RIGHT 105
wait 1
hold RIGHT 37
wait 2
hold RIGHT 52
wait 60
hold RIGHT+A 14
wait 7
hold RIGHT 293
hold DOWN+B 2
wait 58
hold RIGHT 84
wait 1
hold RIGHT 25
hold RIGHT+A 12
wait 15
hold DOWN+B 2
wait 58
hold RIGHT 77
wait 1
hold RIGHT 25
hold RIGHT+A 12
wait 9
hold RIGHT+A 10
wait 8
hold RIGHT+A 32
hold RIGHT 493
wait 200
expect state == 4
expect best_5 == 16
expect goals & 1
